  "changes_2025_to_2026": "None found. The restructured TOU hours were already in force in the 2025/26 books (2025/26 schedule p8 and 2025/26 booklet p47 carry the note that evening peak rose from 2 h to 3 h, morning peak fell from 3 h to 2 h, and a new 2-hour Sunday-evening standard period was added). The 2026/27 booklet (PDF p45) repeats that note; the 2026/27 schedule (p56) drops the note but its Figure 2 is pixel-identical in hours to all three other wheels. Pre-2025 hours were not read from any downloaded PDF and are not stated here. Only holiday-table difference for the overlap: 27 April 2026 Freedom Day = Sunday (2025/26 books) vs Saturday (2026/27 books)."
